# Grafana Dashboard — FastAPI Log Queries

**App:** `cmdbReference="AT56277"` · **Namespace:** `at56277-dev-oneplace-wmgt` · **Env:** DEV

-----

## ⚠️ Fix JSONParserErr First

Your logs show `JSONParserErr` because Loki can’t auto-parse Uvicorn’s default log format.  
Uvicorn access logs look like:

```
INFO:     127.0.0.1:38597 - "GET /api/health HTTP/1.1" 200 OK
```

Add this to **every query** to extract fields and suppress parse errors:

```logql
| pattern `<_> - "<method> <path> <_>" <status> <_>`
| __error__=""
```

