## Dashboard Variables

Add these under **Dashboard Settings → Variables** before building panels:

|Variable        |Type  |Query                                                   |
|----------------|------|--------------------------------------------------------|
|`$pod`          |Query |`label_values({cmdbReference="AT56277"}, pod)`          |
|`$namespace`    |Query |`label_values({cmdbReference="AT56277"}, namespace)`    |
|`$env`          |Query |`label_values({cmdbReference="AT56277"}, opEnvironment)`|
|`$status_filter`|Custom|`2..,4..,5..`                                           |

