## Panel 4 — p95 Latency per Endpoint

**Type:** Time Series

> Requires your app to log response time. FastAPI + `uvicorn-access` logs it as the last field.  
> If missing, add `access_log=True` and a custom log format in your app.

```logql
quantile_over_time(0.95,
  {cmdbReference="AT56277", container="application"}
  | pattern `<_> - "<method> <path> <_>" <status> <bytes> <latency>`
  | __error__=""
  | pod =~ "$pod"
  | unwrap latency
  [$__rate_interval]
) by (path)
```

**Settings:**

- Unit → `ms`
- Legend → `p95 · {{path}}`
- Thresholds → `0 = green`, `500 = yellow`, `1000 = red`

