## Quick Troubleshooting

|Symptom                      |Fix                                                        |
|-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
|`JSONParserErr` on every log |Add `| pattern \`…``+`| **error**=””`                      |
|Bar chart shows no data      |Switch `[$__rate_interval]` → `[$__range]` for count panels|
|p95 latency panel empty      |Check if `<latency>` field exists in your log lines        |
|`$pod` variable shows nothing|Make sure datasource is Loki, not Prometheus               |
|Pattern matches nothing      |Test with `| pattern` in Explore tab first                 |